  "description": "NOC wall (R-15): DSH-01 health matrix, DSH-02 incidents, DSH-03 SLA countdown, CSAT and PRD §4.2 goals. Refresh 30 s (NFR-PERF-01).",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 9000,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
